              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbari ya Efraimu ndeerewiwingieghe Wakanaani werekoghe wikikaia muzi ghwa Gezeri; kwa huwo Wakanaani wikadua aghadi kwawo.",
          "type": "text",
