              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbari ya Zebluni ndeerewiwingieghe awo wandu werekoghe wikikaia andenyi ya iyo mizi ya Kitroni na Nahalali; kwa wundu ugho, Wakanaani wikadua aghadi kwawo, nawo wikadumikishwa.",
